{"id":"3f3056569f28b91e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-unbounded-minimization.md","title":"Unbounded Minimization","display":"df-unbounded-minimization — Unbounded Minimization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-unbounded-minimization","aliases":["92-df-unbounded-minimization","92-df-minimization"],"display":"df-unbounded-minimization — Unbounded Minimization","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-unbounded-minimization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-unbounded-minimization</span><span>92-df-minimization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unbounded-minimization — Unbounded Minimization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (parameter arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_k\">\\(\\mu_k\\)</span> (definition-target unbounded-minimization operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}minimization} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\nD_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\mid\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(g(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;((\\vec x,z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)))\\},\\\\\n\\mu_k(g)&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad \\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_k(g))\\coloneqq D_g,\\\\\n\\mu_k(g)(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{y\\in\\mathbb N\\mid g(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;((\\vec x,z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\}\\qquad(\\vec x\\in D_g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}minimization} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\nD_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\mid\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(g(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;((\\vec x,z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)))\\},\\\\\n\\mu_k(g)&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad \\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_k(g))\\coloneqq D_g,\\\\\n\\mu_k(g)(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{y\\in\\mathbb N\\mid g(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;((\\vec x,z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\}\\qquad(\\vec x\\in D_g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无界极小化：搜索范围无限制</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_y[g(x, y)]\">\\(\\mu_y[g(x, y)]\\)</span></li>\n<li>找最小<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(x, y)\">\\(g(x, y)\\)</span>成立</li>\n<li>若不存在则无定义（部分函数）</li>\n<li>这是递归函数超越PR的关键</li>\n<li>部分递归函数封闭于此</li>\n<li>Turing机可执行无界搜索</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}minimization} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\nD_g&\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\mid\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(g(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z<y\\;((\\vec x,z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)))\\},\\\\\n\\mu_k(g)&:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad \\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_k(g))\\coloneqq D_g,\\\\\n\\mu_k(g)(\\vec x)&\\coloneqq\\min\\{y\\in\\mathbb N\\mid g(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z<y\\;((\\vec x,z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\}\\qquad(\\vec x\\in D_g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_y[g(x, y)]","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"g(x, y)","display":false}],"bytes":1260,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb38790ef6a3828c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu_k$ (minimization operator, see [[92-df-unbounded-minimization]])"},{"id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu_k$ (unbounded minimization, see [[92-df-unbounded-minimization]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-unbounded-minimization]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md]]